# --------------------------------------------------------------- model weights
# Multi-GB engine weights (DiT / text encoder / VAEs). They are environment,
# not source: GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB, and these run to 17 GB.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth

# ------------------------------------------------------------ bundled runtimes
# Portable ComfyUI and a prebuilt stable-diffusion.cpp tree — together ~6 GB of
# DLLs, exes and embedded Python. Both are downloaded, not written here.
ComfyUI_windows_portable/
stable-diffusion.cpp/
comfy-gguf-libs/
models/
Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo/

